utlines the duties and responsibilities of an employee is a:", "options": ["Job description", "Contract", "Memos", "Report"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "A job description outlines duties and responsibilities.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "1822a154-98fe-4ae2-8bd4-5a7013efb34a", "subject_id": "ofp", "subject_name": "Office Practice", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "Which of these is a method of communication?", "options": ["Telephone", "Typewriter", "File", "Cabinet"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Telephone is a communication method.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "1aead5d9-a05d-40c6-8e51-6c684dba0c70", "subject_id": "ofp", "subject_name": "Office Practice", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The process of organizing and coordinating office activities is called:", "options": ["Office management", "Filing", "Bookkeeping", "Typing"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Office management involves organizing and coordinating office activities.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "ef26274a-f757-43ca-8305-6ad632aae141", "subject_id": "ofp", "subject_name": "Office Practice", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "A document used to request goods or services is a:", "options": ["Purchase requisition", "Invoice", "Receipt", "Order"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "A purchase requisition is used to request goods or services.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "409b3510-15c0-4885-893b-b096101ecff2", "subject_id": "ofp", "subject_name": "Office Practice", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "Which of these is a type of correspondence?", "options": ["Letter", "File", "Cabinet", "Desk"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "A letter is a form of correspondence.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "e3b904f6-1b53-45a3-b01f-eb0d6eb1802c", "subject_id": "ofp", 